ALoDLM: Adaptively Looped Diffusion Language Models

This distribution includes a modified WeDLM inference engine from Tencent:
https://github.com/tencent/WeDLM

The wedlm/ package retains upstream copyright and license notices.
Modifications include adaptive recurrent forward passes, depth-aware paged
KV caching, learned halting, committed-token embedding feedback, per-pass
and decision CUDA graphs, and packaging/documentation for ALoDLM.

The governing upstream terms are reproduced in licenses/WeDLM.txt, including
the territorial restriction and the MIT attribution for nano-vllm
(Copyright (c) 2025 Xingkai Yu). Original per-file Apache notices are retained;
they do not replace the governing upstream license included in this release.

The alodlm_optimized/ package supplies the command-line interface, runtime
compatibility adapters, and completed-depth cache repair for ALoDLM.
Amazon-authored material is covered by LICENSE, except where upstream terms
apply. No replacement license grant is made for third-party material.

PyTorch, Transformers, vLLM, FlashAttention, Triton, and other installed
dependencies retain their respective licenses. vLLM supplies the compatible
FlashAttention 2 kernel bundle; requests are executed by the included
ALoDLM-aware engine.
